.DS_Store
# No lock file. CI installs unlocked on purpose, so that an upstream release
# breaking this package surfaces there rather than in a bug report -- and a
# committed lock would have CI testing a dependency set no user of the
# published package has. `just setup` still writes one locally.
uv.lock
.build-check/
